       nothing extra). Natively a valid tool_result with zero surviving buckets is captured as [] and renders
       the friendly "No categories suggested for the current inbox view." box — the P4 leaf "never a blank
       box" rule. The decode is otherwise the EXACT web walk; this only adds a friendly empty where the web is
       silent. Asserted (testEmptyCategoriesArrayIsResolvedNotRejected / testToolResultCapturesResolvedEmpty).

STATES (every one renders — no hidden surface, except the ADR-015 AI-Off gate which renders nothing)
   gatedOff -> feature off -> EmptyView (web withAiFeature -> null). view.opened deferred until non-gated.
   gateLoading -> useAiEnabled resolving -> skeleton chrome.
   ready/idle -> gate on, no proposal -> header + description + Ask-Helix (never blank).
   streaming -> SSE open -> "Helix is thinking…" + thinking indicator.
   empty -> tool_result resolved with 0 categories -> friendly "no categories" box (P4).
   proposal -> tool_result produced buckets -> Apply button + "{category} · {count}" chips.
   stream error -> SSE ended error -> "Helix error: {message}" in the output panel.
   gateError -> gate/context fetch failed -> QueryError peer with Retry.
   stale/offline -> orthogonal connection axis -> freshness chip + banner; one-shot auto-refresh on
                   live->stale; offline disables the suggest action (no stream possible).

